 "notes": "Europe exclusive 180g coral coloured vinyl.\n\nIncludes 24\" x 36\" fold-out poster and download code. The emerald inlay with white text notes written by Giles Peterson (see pics) also doubles up as the poster when opened up. The packaging will come in hard plastic sleeve with a hype sticker on it.\n\nTrack A1\nPublished by: iKhan Sounds, Warner Chappell, SOCAN, Sammy Baby, Diary Publishing\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\n\nTrack A2\nPublished by: Warner Chappell, Diary Publishing, iKhan Sounds, Secret Road Publishing, Phonography Global Publishing, LPC Unlimited Publishing\nRecorded at Fever Studios and Diary Studios\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\n\nTrack A3\nPublished by Warner Chappell / Diary Publishing iKhan Sounds SOCAN / Dr Awkward Publishing\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\nRecorded at Resonate Music, Clearlake Studios, Glenwood Studios & Diary Studios\n\nTrack B1\nPublished by Warner Chappell / Diary Publishing / iKhan Sounds / Off Limits / Phonography Global Publishing / LPC Unlimited Publishing Charly Publishing Limited\nSample Credits \"Too Hot\" embodies a master sample of Eddie Lang \"Gonna Make You Eat Those Words\" an original Bandy recording, licensed from Licensemusiccom ApS.\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\nRecorded at Glenwood Studios & Diary Studios\n\nTrack B2\nPublished by Warner Chappell / Secret Road Music Publishing iKhan Sounds LLC / BMG / Diary Publishing\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\n\nTrack B3\nPublished by Warner Chappell / Diary Publishing / iKhan Sounds\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\nRecorded at Resonate Music, Orange Couch Studios & Diary Studios\n\nTrack B4\nPublished by Warner Chappell / Diary Publishing iKhan Sounds / Secret Road Publishing / Gypsy Man Music\nMastered at Pierce Entertainment\nRecorded at Fever Studios and Diary Studios\n\nA Diary Records / Island Records recording; ℗ 2019 Diary Records Inc, under exclusive licence to Universal Music Operations Limited © 2019 Diary Records Inc\n\nDesign & layout at Studio Island\n\nRunouts: side A \"7725138-A 184178E1/A\" is stamped, rest is etched. Similar for side B.",
